WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:14,480
Isn’t this the leader of Su University?

2
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:17,040
After a hard day's work, I only get this little gain and don't care about your business.

3
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,400
Stop making sarcastic comments here

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,680
We can live well without you, right?

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,600
After all, you are both strong and independent women, so it’s all for nothing. I wish you good luck.

6
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,310
This gap is too big, right?

7
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:33,050
Where did he get all this stuff from?

8
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:38,050
We searched for bananas, grapes, and chickens all day and couldn't even pick a few decent fruits.

9
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:40,130
Yes, I ran so far

10
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,770
All I saw were weeds that I couldn’t name.

11
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:46,030
How about we follow him quietly tomorrow when he goes out to look for something?

12
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:48,490
Okay, let's do it

13
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:50,450
Tomorrow Zhou Ting will follow and take a closer look.

14
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:55,010
Sister Weiwei, why don’t I talk too much while he’s not around?

15
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:57,360
Go directly to his camp to get you first.

16
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,280
If he detains you, I'm not familiar with it

17
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:00,760
Then just follow it

18
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:03,970
What about tracking class reunions?

19
00:01:04,210 --> 00:01:05,570
It's better to run away with two more handfuls of earth and rocks.

20
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:06,850
Do you have the right to speak?

21
00:01:07,210 --> 00:01:08,610
Tomorrow you and your mouth will continue digging

22
00:01:09,010 --> 00:01:32,310
What the hell is he dawdling about?
